{% comment %}
@description: Layout "landing" cho bai viet/trang/san pham - trang HOAN TOAN doc lap, KHONG header/footer/nav/breadcrumb/cart-drawer cua site (khac custom-content.liquid van giu header/footer). Dung cho landing page ban hang thiet ke rieng tu dau den cuoi.
@required_substrings: rawHtml, </head>, </body>
@required_ids:
@notes: File nay KHONG {% layout "layout" %} (co chu dich - khong header/footer). rawHtml DA duoc Liquid-compile boi services/themeRenderer.ts:157-165 truoc khi toi day (admin viet duoc tag/bien Liquid trong noi dung) - o day chi render {{ rawHtml }} RAW trong <body>. PHAI GIU nguyen van chuoi "</head>" va "</body>" that su xuat hien trong HTML sau khi Liquid render xong (khong duoc dung comment/bien che di) - themeRenderer.ts chen JSON-LD schema + analytics scripts (GA/FB Pixel/customHeadScript) bang string-replace ngay TRUOC "</head>", va customFooterScript ngay TRUOC "</body>", AP DUNG CHO MOI TEMPLATE (khong rieng gi layout.liquid) - thieu 1 trong 2 the dong nay se lam site rot schema/tracking/script tuy bien tren landing page. Tailwind self-host giong layout.liquid (script + tailwind.config mau brand) de rawHtml dung class Tailwind van chay dung - neu rawHtml tu viet CSS rieng thi script nay khong gay hai gi (chi khong dung toi).
{% endcomment %}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{ pageTitle | default: site.siteName }}</title>
    {% if site.faviconUrl %}<link rel="icon" href="{{ site.faviconUrl }}">{% endif %}
    {% if metaDescription %}<meta name="description" content="{{ metaDescription | escape }}">{% endif %}
    {% if noindex %}<meta name="robots" content="noindex">{% endif %}

    <script src="/theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/tailwind.js"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        brand: {
                            dark: '#0A132B',
                            DEFAULT: '#2563eb',
                            hover: '#1d4ed8',
                            light: '#eff6ff',
                            gray: '#64748B'
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
</head>
<body>
{{ rawHtml }}
</body>
</html>
